{
  "title": "Aamal & Duas for the days of Ramadhan",
  "code": "012",
  "data": "Recite the following supplication every day during the month of Ramadan, as reported by Shaykh al-Mufid and Shaykh al-Tusi:\nاَللّٰهُمَّ هٰذَا شَهْرُ رَمَضَانَ الْمُبَارَكُ الَّذِيْۤ اَنْزَلْتَ فِيْهِ الْقُرْاٰنَ هُدًى لِّلنَّاسِ وَ بَيِّنَاتٍ مِّنَ الْهُدٰى وَ الْفُرْقَانِ\nALLAAHUMMA HAADHA SHAHRU RAMADAANAL MUBAARAKUL LAZEE ANZALTA FEEHIL QUR'AANA HUDAL LINNAASI WA BAYYINAATIM MINAL HUDAA WAL FURQAAN\nO Allah, this is the blessed month of Ramadan in which You revealed the Qur'an as a guidance for humankind and clear proofs of the guidance and the Criterion.\nفَعَظَّمْتَ حُرْمَتَهٗ بِمَاۤ اَنْزَلْتَ فِيْهِ مِنَ الْقُرْاٰنِ وَ خَصَصْتَهٗ بِالصِّيَامِ\nFA-A'ZZAMTA HURMATAHOO BIMAA ANZALTA FEEHI MINAL QUR'AANI WA KHASAS-TAHOO BIS-SIYAAM\nSo You magnified its sanctity by revealing the Qur'an therein, and singled it out with fasting.\nاَللّٰهُمَّ فَصَلِّ عَلٰى مُحَمَّدٍ وَّ اٰلِ مُحَمَّدٍ وَّ سَلِّمْهُ لِيْ وَ سَلِّمْنِيْ فِيْهِ وَ تَسَلَّمْهُ مِنِّيْ فِيْ يُسْرٍ مِّنْكَ وَ عَافِيَةٍ\nALLAAHUMMA FA-SALLI A'LAA MUHAMMADIN WA AALI MUHAMMADIN WA SALLIMHU LEE WA SALLIMNEE FEEHI WA TASALLAMHU MINNEE FEE YUSRIM MINKA WA A'AFIYAH\nO Allah, send blessings upon Muhammad and the Household of Muhammad, and preserve it for me, and preserve me in it, and receive it from me in ease and well-being from You.",
  "merits": "Supplications and litanies recommended to be recited during the days of the holy month of Ramadan."
}
